antigravity.google | no request by the app: the provider install command the user runs in the terminal, as before this round
api.anthropic.com | chosen provider: key check against the provider the user connected
api.bitbucket.org | integration: Bitbucket Cloud API with the user's own credentials
api.github.com | integration and release feed: GitHub API and the releases list
api.linear.app | integration: Linear API with the user's own credentials
api.moonshot.ai | chosen provider: key check against the provider the user connected
api.openai.com | chosen provider: key check against the provider the user connected
cursor.com | no request by the app: the provider install command the user runs in the terminal, as before this round
example.com | no request: a placeholder URL handed to the macOS proxy lookup in artifact_mirror.rs
gbframe.localhost | no request: the sandboxed frame scheme named in its CSP
generativelanguage.googleapis.com | chosen provider: key check against the provider the user connected
github.com.helper | no request: a git config key that selects the credential helper for github.com
openrouter.ai | chosen provider: key check against the provider the user connected
raw.githubusercontent.com | release feed: changelog text and images of a published release
sentry.io | integration: Sentry issues with the user's own token
slack.com | integration: Slack API with the user's own token
